---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import aboutImage from '../assets/photos/about.webp';
---

<section id="about" class="section about">
	<div class="container">
		<h2 class="section-title">About the Race</h2>
		<div class="about-content">
			<div class="about-text">
				<div class="card">
					<h3 class="card-title">The Ultimate Trail Experience</h3>
					<p class="card-text">
						The Tsitsikamma Ultra is a challenging 50km trail run with 2,500m of elevation, taking you deep into some of South Africa’s most spectacular indigenous forests, mountain trails and coastal landscapes. Starting at Storms River and finishing in Covie, this is proper mountain running — technical trails, big climbs, rivers, forests and wild, remote terrain.
					</p>
					<p class="card-text">
						The Tsitsikamma Lite brings the same wild Tsitsikamma spirit over 30km, with around 1,500m of elevation. Starting at Lottering Forestry Station, the route climbs through the mountains, passes Bloukrans Hut and winds its way through the forest before finishing in Covie.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="about-image-container">
				<div class="card image-card">
					<Image src={aboutImage} alt="Two trail runners crossing a rocky riverbed with waterfall in the background during the Tsitsikamma race - Photo: Carmen Claire" class="about-image" widths={[400, 800, 1200]} sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw" />
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.about {
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--background-color) 0%, rgba(34, 51, 59, 0.8) 100%);
		scroll-margin-top: 60px;
	}

	.about-content {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 3rem;
		align-items: stretch;
	}

	.about-text {
		display: flex;
	}

	.about-image-container {
		display: flex;
	}

	.about-text .card,
	.about-image-container .card {
		height: 100%;
		flex: 1;
	}

	.card-title {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		color: var(--primary-color);
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.card-text {
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.card-text:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.image-card {
		padding: 0;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.about-image {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		transition: transform 0.3s ease;
	}

	.about-image:hover {
		transform: scale(1.05);
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.about-content {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 2rem;
		}
	}
</style>